{"id":"re_gion","lemma":"région","pos":"noun","rank":1735,"glosses":["region; area","a political subdivision of France and some other Francophone countries, bigger than a département"],"ipa":"/ʁe.ʒjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/Fr-r%C3%A9gion.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A9gion.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"régions"},"formAudio":{"régions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-r%C3%A9gions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Cette région a complètement changé.","en":"This area has changed completely.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"completely"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"changer"}]},{"text":"Cette région s'est complètement transformée.","en":"This region has completely changed.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"completely"},{"g":"transform"}]},{"text":"Son nom est connu de tous dans cette région.","en":"His name is known to everybody in this area.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"name"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"known"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Je vis dans une région isolée.","en":"I live in a remote area.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"isolated","l":"isolé"}]},{"text":"La situation dans la région s'est stabilisée.","en":"The situation in the region has stabilized.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"stabilized","l":"stabilisé"}]}]}